# The code hosts Althar trusts by default, inside its Flatpak and through the
# device's ssh (flatpak/host-ssh.sh): each host's keys as its vendor publishes
# them, checked against the SHA256 fingerprints in the vendor's own docs by
# apps/desktop/tests/knownHosts.test.ts. Never refreshed with ssh-keyscan at
# build time: a key changes here only by hand, against those docs.
# Hosts: the ones Althar's code-host connections know (GitHub, GitLab,
# Bitbucket Cloud), Codeberg and Azure DevOps, with the SSH-over-443
# endpoints that serve the same keys.

